  "description": "O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this impressive duplex apartment with incredible reception space in the popular Crescent Court development. \r\n\r\nLocated on Father Griffin Road, Crescent Court is ideal for Galway City living being within walking distance to all Galway has to offer. \r\n\r\nBuilt in 2002, Crescent Court is a secured gated development with lift access & well-maintained communal areas. \r\n\r\nNo.33 Crescent Court is offered in very good condition with spacious accommodation of approximately 96.2 sq.m throughout. \r\n\r\nUpon entry, the property offers three well proportioned bedrooms, all with fitted storage & the main bedroom availing of its own en-suite & balcony, as well as a main bathroom & under-stairs storage.\r\n\r\nA key feature of no.33 Crescent Court is the upper floor reception-kitchen area. The open-plan space boasts vaulted ceiling giving an excellent sense of space & dual aspect allowing the room to be filled with natural light. An additional balcony is accessible via the reception area. \r\n\r\nCrescent Court is wonderfully positioned with everything on your doorstep. Local amenities such as Tescos are postioned in the ground floor of the building, whilst within walking distance are a host of local amenities & restaurants being within proximity to Latin Quarter, City Centre & West. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, Crescent Court is within walking distance to Galway University, UCHG, South Park & Salthill Promenade. \r\n\r\nNo.33 Crescent Court will prove to an ideal property for a variety of purchasers, whether for investment or owner occupancy, considering the impressive space, quality condition & ideal location.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \r\n\r\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \r\nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\r\n\r\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \r\n\r\nNOTE:  These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer.  They are for information only and give a general idea of the property.  They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.  Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy.  Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.  No person in the employment of O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.",
